  "id": "felt-need",
  "term": "felt need",
  "definition": "In this source, a felt need refers to a person’s subjective sense that they should do something in a social situation, especially the pressure to match other people’s behavior or responses. Here it means experiencing an internal push to conform even when others are clearly wrong.",
